            %p
              By the discussion at
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-action"} ∞-action
              this exhibits a
              = succeed "-action" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi b
                        %mi p
                      %mi ℝ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} b^{p}\mathbb{R}
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi b
                        %mrow
                          %mn 2
                          %mi p
                          %mo +
                          %mn 2
                      %mi ℝ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} b^{2p+2}\mathbb{R}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi b
                      %mrow
                        %mn 2
                        %mi p
                        %mo +
                        %mn 2
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %msup
                      %mi b
                      %mi p
                    %mi ℝ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} b^{2p+2} \mathbb{R}/b^{p}\mathbb{R}
              is the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+quotient"} homotopy quotient
          .num_example
            %h6#example_13 Example
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi p
                    %mo =
                    %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p=2
              and regarded as a statement in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+homotopy+theory"} rational homotopy theory
              via remark
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#RationalSpheres"}
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#b2RactionOnb2p2R"}
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sullivan+minimal+model"} Sullivan minimal model
              for the rationalized
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hopf+fibration"} Hopf fibration
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mi S
                              %mn 3
                          %mtd
                            %mo ⟶
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mi S
                              %mn 7
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mi S
