                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \,
          %p This confirms a conjecture due to
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "https://ncatlab.org/schreiber/show/Equivariant+cohomology+of+M2/M5-branes#Sati10"}> Sati 10, section 6.3
            ,
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "https://ncatlab.org/schreiber/show/Equivariant+cohomology+of+M2/M5-branes#Sati13"} Sati 13, section 2.5
          %p based on the observation that
          %p
            the
