            about asymptotic singular loci in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BPS+state"} BPS state
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
            solutions is due to
          %ul
            %li#ClausKalloshProeyen97
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Piet+Claus"}> Piet Claus
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renata+Kallosh"} Renata Kallosh
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antoine+Van+Proeyen"} Antoine Van Proeyen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    M 5-brane and superconformal
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mn 0
                          %mo ,
                          %mn 2
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (0,2)
                    tensor multiplet in 6 dimensions
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9711161"} arXiv:hep-th/9711161
            %li#ClausKalloshKumarTownsend98
              %p
                Piet Claus,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Renata+Kallosh"} Renata Kallosh
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antoine+Van+Proeyen"} Antoine Van Proeyen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Conformal Theory of M2, D3, M5 and ‘D1+D5’ Branes
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9801206"} arXiv:hep-th/9801206
            %li#AFFFTT98
              %p
                Gianguido Dall’Agata, Davide Fabbri, Christophe Fraser,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    The
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Osp
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mn 8
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                          %mn 4
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Osp(8|4)
                    singleton action from the supermembrane
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9807115"} arXiv:hep-th/9807115
            %li#PastiSorokinTonin99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paolo+Pasti"}> Paolo Pasti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitri+Sorokin"} Dmitri Sorokin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Branes in Super-AdS Backgrounds and Superconformal Theories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9912076"} arXiv:hep-th/9912076
          %p
            The bosonic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+Lie+2-algebra"} string Lie 2-algebra
            is discussed in the appendix of
          %ul
            %li#BCSS05
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"}> John Baez
              , Alissa Crans,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Danny+Stevenson"} Danny Stevenson
              = succeed "," do
                %em From loop groups to 2-groups
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0504123"} arXiv:math/0504123
          %p
            Its role in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+anomaly+cancellation"} Green-Schwarz anomaly cancellation
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li#SatiSchreiberStasheff12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jim+Stasheff"} Jim Stasheff
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Twisted+Differential+String+and+Fivebrane+Structures"} Twisted Differential String and Fivebrane Structures
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0910.4001"} arXiv:0910.4001
          %p
            and its role in the flux quantization of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+C-field"} supergravity C-field
            in
          %ul
            %li#FiorenzaSatiSchreiber12a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+moduli+3-stack+of+the+C-field"} The moduli 3-stack of the C-field
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1202.2455"} arXiv:1202.2455
          %p and
          %ul
            %li#FiorenzaSatiSchreiber12b
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/7d+Chern-Simons+theory+and+the+5-brane"} Multiple M5-branes, String 2-connections, and 7d nonabelian Chern-Simons theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1201.5277"} arXiv:1201.5277
          %p
            Our discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-infinity+algebra+cohomology"} L-infinity algebra cohomology
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#SatiSchreiberStasheff08
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jim+Stasheff"} Jim Stasheff
              = succeed "," do
                %em L-infinity algebra connections and applications to String- and Chern-Simons n-transport
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0801.3480"} arXiv:0801.3480
          %p
            The observation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/brane+bouquet"} brane bouquet
            in super
            = succeed "-algebra" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi L
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+WZW+terms"} higher WZW terms
            from higher
            = succeed "-cocycles" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi L
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\infty
          %ul
            %li#FSS13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+brane+bouquet"} Super Lie n-algebra extensions, higher WZW models and super p-branes with tensor multiplet fields
              International Journal of Geometric Methods in Modern Physics Volume 12, Issue 02 (2015) 1550018, (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1308.5264"}> arXiv:1308.5264
              )
          %p see also
          %ul
            %li#HSS19
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Huerta"}> John Huerta
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em Real ADE-equivariant (co)homotopy and Super M-branes
              %strong 371
              (2019) 425 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-019-03442-3"}> doi:10.1007/s00220-019-03442-3
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.05987"} arXiv:1805.05987
          %p
            The homotopy-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent"} descent
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            cocycle and of the type IIA
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane"} D-brane
            cocycles is due to
          %ul
            %li#FSS15
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+WZW+term+of+the+M5-brane"} The WZW term of the M5-brane and differential cohomotopy
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.07557"} arXiv:1506.07557
            %li#FSS16a
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Rational+sphere+valued+supercocycles+in+M-theory"} Rational sphere valued supercocycles in M-theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1606.03206"} arXiv:1606.03206
          %p
            The derivation of supersymmetric
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+T-duality"} topological T-duality
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+T-folds"} super T-folds
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#FSS16b
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/T-Duality+from+super+Lie+n-algebra+cocycles+for+super+p-branes"} T-Duality from super Lie n-algebra cocycles for super p-branes
              %strong 22
              5 (2018) (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.06536"}> arXiv:1611.06536
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.4310/ATMP.2018.v22.n5.a3"} doi:10.4310/ATMP.2018.v22.n5.a3
          %p
            and the mathematical formulation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+dimensional+reduction"} double dimensional reduction
            that this uses is further discussed in
          %ul
            %li#BMSS18
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vincent+Braunack-Mayer"}> Vincent Braunack-Mayer
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Gauge+enhancement+of+Super+M-Branes"} Gauge enhancement of Super M-Branes via rational parameterized stable homotopy theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.01115"} arXiv:1806.01115
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-019-03441-4"} doi:10.1007/s00220-019-03441-4
          %p
            The derivation of the process of higher invariant extensions that leads from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superpoint"} superpoint
            to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
          %ul
            %li#MTheoryFromTheSuperpoint
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Huerta"}> John Huerta
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/M-Theory+from+the+Superpoint"} M-Theory from the Superpoint
              %strong 108
              (2018) 2695–2727 (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.01774"}> arXiv:1702.01774
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s11005-018-1110-z"} doi:10.1007/s11005-018-1110-z
          %p
            General discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+cohomology"} twisted cohomology
            is in:
          %ul
            %li#NSS12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Nikolaus"}> Thomas Nikolaus
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Danny+Stevenson"} Danny Stevenson
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Principal+%E2%88%9E-bundles+--+theory%2C+presentations+and+applications"} Principal ∞-bundles – General theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1207.0248"} arXiv:1207.0248
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+Character+Map+in+Twisted+Non-Abelian+Cohomology"} The Character Map in Twisted Non-Abelian Cohomology
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.11909"}> arXiv:2009.11909
                )
          %p Foundations and parts of the story is in:
          %ul
            %li#dcct
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+a+cohesive+topos"} differential cohomology in a cohesive topos
        .revisedby
